Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish If you want it,\Ngotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What I wouldn't give to see her once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this is the\NOidon's final procession.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She belongs in the capital with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She rebelled against Shogun Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cremate her at the prisoners'\Nquarters in Rosetsu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They captured him? That was sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:03:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That Tonoyasu guy is Ushimitsu Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't strike me as a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the rumors are true, our new\Nfriend is quite the influential figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He robs from the rich, a hero who\Ngives to the poor and powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me that\Nguy's a secret badass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ushimitsu Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that name over and\Nover in the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They called him a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he really is a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a live projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone laughing at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend's getting strung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You still find it hard to\Nbelieve that he's Ushimitsu Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But for right now,\Nthat's hardly the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never forget that heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonoyasu is merely an alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What has this guy been hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of buzz going on\Nin the capital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better tune in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone turn on the light scroll, Snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that guy someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he's quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in my day, he was a\Ndaimyo under the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's to say, he was a\Nclose associate of Lord Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimutsuki Yasui.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The daimyo of Hakumai—that's Yasuie,\Nthe hedgehog—known for his austerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He was famous for rarely smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,even as he stood right before\Nme, I failed to recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,recognize him Stop the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Olive Hakamai still loves you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie him, you monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't forget about\Nme after all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.22,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakumai holds a unique\Nposition in the land of Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in that it is the only region\Nwith a legitimate port.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Some visitors wish us well,\Nbut others wish us harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The course is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army must be an unassailable force!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, you've got the\Nstrongest samurai in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to fool\Naround, Odin. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to loiter here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize that you're the son of\Nthe shogun, not some hapless vagrant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I was kicked out of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have been kicked out\Nof the family for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you've heard the talk people say:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"odin will never be heir\Nto kozuki." Hey, Sukiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasui will become the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't put so much stock in idle chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the true successor of the\NKozuki clan, beyond any doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Tsukiyaki only kicked you out because\Nhe loves you and wants you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You should try to meet his expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But frankly, if I had it my\Nway, I'd rather go out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just my luck living in a\Ncountry with closed borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This isolation policy is\Nsuch a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you're a proper samurai, you've\Nno right to criticize this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't hurt, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just keep knocking\Nme around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere hoodlum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Orochi\Nis going to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I want to apologize for two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd like to say something\Nto that moron Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get that off my chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can head to the great beyond\Nwith a smile on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now read the\Ncharges of the accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, he was caught committing\Na theft in the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A shameless sycophant,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,this former daimyo of\NHakubai has been reduced
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to begging for coin as\Na lowly entertainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Shimotsuki Yasui.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He once committed the heinous crime of\Nrebelling against the shogun Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He will serve as an offering on this day\Nof the Oiran Gomorrah Saki's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We hereby sentence him\Nto a dishonorable death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,according to his statement,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he is also the serial\Nthief Ushimitsu Koza,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who is a well-known public\Nmenace in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Figured I might as well grab all your\Nattention one last time, since I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for laughing, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flattered you thought\NI was a hero, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is perplexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yasui got the attention he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The uproar surrounding the Oedon's\Nfuneral has been redirected to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Drake, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Evisu Town are rioting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're charging into the\Nflower capital in droves!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made an error.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We underestimated how important\Nthis man was to the common people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you go dyin' on us, Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't have you to support us,\Nwe'll be dead and rotting in a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to Ebisu Town, you beggars!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to enter here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowds on the main\Nstreet are running wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In the West District, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In retrospect,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi's decision to\Nbroadcast the execution through
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the light scrolls may have\Nbeen somewhat short-sighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep an eye on\Nthe other areas as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel sorry\Nfor the Shogun's poor flunkies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Must not be easy working for a damn idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, if you would, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaze upon the beauty\Nof the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our land of Wano shines brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This nation is our pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For it was won by generations\Nof hard work by the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and the people who supported them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that bastard running\Nhis mouth a second longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not your doing in the\Nleast, you greedy old snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me, Kurosamine Orochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't built an inch of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All you've done is polluted\Nour fields and forests,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,our rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,our villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All of their splendor has\Nbeen tainted by your greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but famine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can set fire to my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And not suffer the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You said more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make the Shogun angry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something else I should add.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Another apology while I\Nstill have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about the flyer with the symbol\Nthat's been going around lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki name died out 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't form an army\Nto avenge them if I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want people to forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I made that flyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The symbol doesn't mean anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At all the cheese expense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why would he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Ashura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you, did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, at least Lord Yasui's\Nalive for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw, though I was late to\Nfind out just as you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's become quite the spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When Lord Odin died 20 years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin asked the four remaining\NDamiel, including myself, a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would we serve under the\NKarotsumi clan or fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What a laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You owed everything you had to Odin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but you stole the Shogun's throne\Nout from under him with deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and treachery, what fool would serve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The daimyo and people from every region\Nraised up their swords without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were no match for that monster\NKaido who crushed all opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Lamb of Wano paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I lost my chance to\Ndie with honor in that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So I took on a disguise and hid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I would be ashamed if I died\Nof old age, living this lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, channeling my inner child,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:18:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I came up with this flyer trick\Nas a final act of rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would forgive this\Nold fool, but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,turns out Orji was a bigger\Ncoward than I ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He got so spooked by the whole thing that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he jailed innocent\Npeople just because they
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,followed a stylish little trend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was all in his head this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're locked away a ton of people!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there, Lord Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've said enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to pump you full of lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you in ages, Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any more last\Nwords, save them fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:19:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to recite\Nthe poem that binds your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A man of such small\Ncaliber shall never know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the taste of Odin for as\Nlong as he shall live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this is it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon and the rest of the Akataya\NSamurai, you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And Momonosuke, I know\Nyou'll be Shogun someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan has not been undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It has merely been reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your allies in Rosetsu\NTown have not been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them a new rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not be much, but this is all\NI can do with what's left of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel we're helpless to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he's sacrificing\Nhimself to keep our plan alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing more I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, no matter what that coward\Nor what she goes on about,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,his soldiers won't listen to him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting real sick of\Nthe Shogun's paranoia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say that out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.32,0:21:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For 20 long years, we\Nbowed our heads in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.36,0:21:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For what could we do\Nbefore the might of Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, things will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover your children's eyes! For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the final Dome to serve Kozuki, or rather,\Nthe happy-go-lucky fool from Evisutown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,makes his final journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go out singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kakarone Gashima, avenge\Nyour lord at long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall await the good\Nnews in the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, trying\Nto steal all this money,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin was running short on cash, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna kill us, then\Ndo it, you damn hedgehog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you find these people, Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you tried to steal my\Nmoney, but I'll let you keep it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.34,0:23:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider, Lord Yasui.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakumai needs those funds\Nmuch more than they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.16,0:23:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're at it, here's a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more money?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a catch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly love Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.98,0:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, use this money\Nto clean yourselves up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy some books.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn some manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a bunch of unruly thugs as\Nvassals will only bring shame to Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I'm sure, he will become\Nthe Shogun of the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, those who support\Nhim must not only be loyal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:24:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,they must be the finest\Nsamurai in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.36,0:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes without saying that\Nyou must protect your lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But the people of Wano will\Ncome to depend on you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.06,0:24:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a symbol of our\Nstrength, our guardian deities.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.78,0:24:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.08,0:24:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:24:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.04,0:25:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Otoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.76,0:25:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Otoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'll be leaving you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.68,0:25:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.59,0:25:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.51,0:25:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.38,0:25:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You may cease firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.56,0:25:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those beggars from Ebisu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.30,0:25:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick them out of the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.62,0:25:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.06,0:26:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.94,0:26:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.48,0:26:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.66,0:26:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.26,0:26:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that damn rat finally dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.16,0:26:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasuie is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.84,0:27:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.56,0:27:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.84,0:27:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.14,0:27:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that this is a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.66,0:28:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.48,0:28:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, they are all crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.42,0:28:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The people from Ebizu\NTown are always smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.62,0:28:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because even when they're hurting or\Nsad, they can't show it on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they're suffering, they've been\Nrobbed of everything but their smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.34,0:28:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, all they can do is laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Orochi, they\Nbrought something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an evil fruit that they call Smile.
